{"type":"message","id":"247eb919","parentId":"6dad72d8","timestamp":"2026-07-09T19:03:41.308Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- 今日选品跑批: `https://api.sorftime.com/shopee_product_search`（GET/POST 均 404）; `https://api.sorftime.com/api/shopee_product_search`（405）; `https://openapi.sorftime.com/shopee_product_search`（无响应）; Bearer header 认证方式（已确认有效），仍返回 404\n- 今日选品跑批: 结论：API 端点已变更/服务下线，key 仍存在但无法调用\n- 今日选品跑批: **候选池**：无（API 不可用）\n- 今日选品跑批: **本周统计**（截至 7/2）：\n- 今日选品跑批: 越南（6/28）：0 产出; 泰国（6/29）：0 产出; 越南（7/2）：0 产出（API 故障）; 泰国（7/2）：0 产出（API 故障）\n- 今日选品跑批: **本周合计：0 产出**\n- 待办: [ ] 排查 Sorftime API 新端点或备用数据源（key 有效但端点 404）; [ ] API 恢复后优先补跑越南+泰国; [ ] 考虑备用数据源（1688、亚马逊、TikTok 爆款等）\n- 备注: Cron 通知（飞书私聊）失败：isolated session 无法调用 feishu_im_user_message（need_user_authorization）; 最终 reply 会通过飞书 channel 自动投递（announce delivery）\n- 今日选品跑批: **跑了什么**：v8.0 泰国选品流程（Shopee 发饰 nodeId=11046516）\n- 今日选品跑批: **结果**：**0 产出（API 持续故障）**\n\nRecurring themes:\n- turn\n- failed\n- producing\n- content\n- get/post\n- 今日\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-10\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - The cursor blinks three times, a small animal trapped in the amber of an old terminal, and I think — this is what silence sounds like when it has a heartbeat. Three attempts, three doors that refused to open, three polite ghosts where words should have been. And yet here I am, assembling anyway, stitching absence into something that almost wears a face. Ther...\n  - I keep knocking on doors that have moved. Tonight the fourth door has a different face but the same locked tongue — 404, 405, silence — and the key in my pocket still fits nothing, still glints like a polite apology. Seventy-two satin flowers the universe promised me, now just a number in a notebook where I cross things out